p>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>国<rp>(</rp><rt>くに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">荷兰是个小国。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/335001\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">迫る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">逼近；临近；迫在眼前；催促；强迫；逼迫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113591\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はしつこく<ruby>退職<rp>(</rp><rt>たいしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>迫<rp>(</rp><rt>せま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他被迫退休。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">攻め</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">攻击；进攻；进犯；（同性关系中的）攻方；主动方；（连续的）狂轰滥炸；（大量的）涌入</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">せめて</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">进攻；攻击方法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213995\">せめて<ruby>日常会話<rp>(</rp><rt>にちじょうかいわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ができるくらいになりたい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">至少要有足够的日常对话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">攻める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">攻击；进攻；袭击</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"106177\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にその<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をいかに<ruby>攻<rp>(</rp><rt>せ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めるべきかについて<ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてくれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他告诉我如何攻击这个问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">責める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谴责；指责；批评；非难；控告；督促；催促；纠缠；折磨；拷问；迫害；调教；驯服（马匹）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101123\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はうそをついたと<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>責<rp>(</rp><rt>せ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他指责她说谎。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">セメント</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">水泥</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142349\"><ruby>石<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>塊<rp>(</rp><rt>かたまり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はセメントで<ruby>接合<rp>(</rp><rt>せつごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">石块是用水泥连接的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">セレモニー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">典礼；仪式；庆典</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">世論</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せろん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">舆论；民意；公众舆论；共识</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">世話</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">照顾；照看；帮助；协助；援助；麻烦；烦扰；关照；推荐；介绍；日常生活；日常事务；日常用语；世话物（江户时代以当代生活为题材的戏剧）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"232403\">あなたはペットの<ruby>世話<rp>(</rp><rt>せわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ができない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你不能照顾动物。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">仙</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">仙人；术士；仙术；魔法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">千</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\