=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"88232\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>先日<rp>(</rp><rt>せんじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她昨天买了一间新房子。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">戦術</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せんじゅつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">战术；战法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96681\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>戦術<rp>(</rp><rt>せんじゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>急<rp>(</rp><rt>きゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>変更<rp>(</rp><rt>へんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>軍<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>後退<rp>(</rp><rt>こうたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>させた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们突然改变了战术,使军队落后。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">センス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">品味；审美；风格感；幽默感</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"118797\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>素晴<rp>(</rp><rt>すば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らしいユーモアのセンスがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他有很好的幽默感。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">扇子</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せんす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-